\ The import side reports every conflicting name at once, so an allowlist filters the reported set
\ rather than stopping at the first listed name. Both `alpha` and `beta` are already defined here;
\ only `alpha` is listed, so the report still names `beta`.

alpha: ( -- fixnum ) [ 8 ] ;
beta: ( -- fixnum ) [ 9 ] ;

use "import_collision_two_mod.1z" ;
